  "document": "Countess Albertine Agnes of Nassau\nAlbertine Agnes of Nassau( April 9, 1634 – May 26, 1696), was regent of Friesland, Groningen and Drenthe during the minority of her son Henry Casimir II, Count of Nassau- Dietz. She was the sixth child and fifth daughter of stadtholder Frederick Henry, Prince of Orange and Amalia of Solms- Braunfels."
